# <%= current_page.data.title %>
## About

This runbooks page contains guidance on regular tasks that the Platform Operations support role may be expected to perform in relation to Entra ID (Azure AD) and related services.

### Add user to Entra ID Group for NOMIS Modernisation Platform SSO

These requests are typically raised via the [#ask-digital-studio-ops](https://moj.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C6D94J81E) Slack channel, and should be actioned by the support engineer on duty.

#### Steps

- Log into the [Azure Portal](https://portal.azure.com/#home)

- In user profile (top right) select **Switch Directory** and select the **Ministry of Justice** directory from list below. Hit `Switch`.

- Select Microsoft Entra ID, and then select **Groups** from the left-hand menu.

- In the search bar, add `azure-aws-sso-nomis-access` and select the group from the results.

- Navigate to **Users**, and then select `+ Add members` from the top menu.

- Drop the provided username in the search bar, tick the checkbox next to the user, and select **Select** from the bottom menu.

Once added, inform the user that they may have to wait as long as 6 hours for the change to take effect. 


